window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Aubry Kaiser doesn't like people - actually, that's not right. She loathes people. With her crippling anxiety, there's no way she can demo her favorite video game at a convention with 5,000 other people. Maybe if she brings someone to act as a shield. </p> <p>But the only person available is the sexy cowboy she can't stand. </p> <p>Quinn Baldwyn is in a mess of his own. He's been dodging his wealthy family's matchmaking attempts - and life advice - for years, but with his sister's wedding on the horizon, he needs a shield of his own. </p> <p>He and Aubry can barely hold down a civil conversation, but in bed: fireworks. And the closer they get to Quinn's sister's wedding, the more he realizes that he might actually like Aubry. </p> <p>Now it's up to him to convince her that she might actually like him, too. </p>"; 
